WEBVTT

00:00:04.024 --> 00:00:06.994
Magic Knight Rayearth
I, Hikaru Shidou, along with
Umi Ryuuzaki and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:06.994 --> 00:00:07.984
I, Hikaru Shidou, along with
Umi Ryuuzaki and Fuu Hououji...

00:00:08.094 --> 00:00:11.334
...was summoned back
to the world called Cephiro.

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:12.034
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...

00:00:12.034 --> 00:00:14.004
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...
Autozam

00:00:14.004 --> 00:00:16.144
This country lost the Pillar who
supported it, Princess Emeraude...
Eagle

00:00:16.144 --> 00:00:16.504
...and was facing total destruction.
Eagle

00:00:16.504 --> 00:00:18.474
...and was facing total destruction.
Geo Zazu

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:20.514
Three countries were invading
in hopes of taking Cephiro...
Chizeta

00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:21.514
Three countries were invading
in hopes of taking Cephiro...

00:00:21.514 --> 00:00:23.984
Three countries were invading
in hopes of taking Cephiro...
Tarta Tatra

00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:26.014
...but there's also
an unknown force after Cephiro.
Fahren

00:00:26.014 --> 00:00:28.014
...but there's also
an unknown force after Cephiro.
Sang Yung Chang Ang

00:00:28.014 --> 00:00:28.414
Aska

00:00:28.414 --> 00:00:29.724
Debonair...
Aska

00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:30.524
...and Nova,
a girl who looks like me.
Aska

00:00:30.524 --> 00:00:31.284
...and Nova,
a girl who looks like me.

00:00:31.284 --> 00:00:32.654
...and Nova,
a girl who looks like me.
Lantis

00:00:32.654 --> 00:00:33.724
I wonder who they really are...
Lantis

00:00:33.724 --> 00:00:35.724
I wonder who they really are...
Castle Debonair

00:00:35.724 --> 00:00:36.724
Nova entered my heart
and tried to change how I felt.
Castle Debonair

00:00:36.724 --> 00:00:41.134
Nova entered my heart
and tried to change how I felt.
Debonair

00:00:41.134 --> 00:00:41.734
Thanks to Presea's help,
I was able to triumph over Nova...
Debonair

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:43.634
Thanks to Presea's help,
I was able to triumph over Nova...

00:00:43.634 --> 00:00:44.934
Thanks to Presea's help,
I was able to triumph over Nova...
Nova

00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:46.304
But her words...
Nova

00:00:46.604 --> 00:00:48.334
I am Hikaru.

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:50.304
What did she mean by that?

00:00:50.404 --> 00:00:52.604
Nova is now in the castle.

00:00:53.514 --> 00:00:55.414
She's going to kill Lantis?

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:58.104
I'll never let her
do something like that!

00:00:58.214 --> 00:00:59.344
Lantis!

00:01:01.154 --> 00:01:07.524
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:08.324 --> 00:01:15.354
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:01:17.734 --> 00:01:21.174
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:21.274 --> 00:01:26.334
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:01:27.744 --> 00:01:33.244
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:01:34.414 --> 00:01:37.214
And then the light
that floods down...

00:01:37.554 --> 00:01:44.184
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:52.334
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:01:52.474 --> 00:01:59.534
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:05.774
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:02:06.784 --> 00:02:11.744
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:02:12.754 --> 00:02:19.184
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:27.104
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:02:30.144 --> 00:02:36.134
Giant Sang Yung vs. The NSX!

00:02:43.124 --> 00:02:47.214
When the kids were no longer
afraid, the monsters grew weaker?

00:02:48.494 --> 00:02:49.484
Yes.

00:02:54.164 --> 00:02:58.104
Then the people's hearts
really are creating the monsters...

00:03:01.404 --> 00:03:05.234
This castle is made by
the people of Cephiro too...

00:03:06.444 --> 00:03:09.904
Can you tell us what
you are thinking about?

00:03:11.444 --> 00:03:14.444
We discussed that
in this room a while back.

00:03:14.554 --> 00:03:20.324
That if something was bothering you,
and you felt you could tell us...

00:03:21.054 --> 00:03:22.784
...you would let us know.

00:03:22.994 --> 00:03:25.184
Hikaru, you said...

00:03:25.734 --> 00:03:30.034
...that the three of us will fight
together till the end, no matter what.

00:03:30.134 --> 00:03:34.234
I want the three of us to fight
your concerns together as well.

00:03:35.004 --> 00:03:36.094
Fuu...

00:03:36.804 --> 00:03:37.894
Umi...

00:04:07.134 --> 00:04:09.904
Why won't he send us a single word?

00:04:13.644 --> 00:04:17.674
Knowing Eagle, I'm sure
that he has some plan in mind.

00:04:17.784 --> 00:04:21.804
Or maybe there's another
reason why he can't call us...

00:04:25.894 --> 00:04:29.654
He doesn't have enough
time left to be waiting around...

00:04:30.964 --> 00:04:31.924
What?

00:04:33.134 --> 00:04:34.694
Did you say something, Geo?

00:04:34.694 --> 00:04:36.394
Did you say something, Geo?
Nothing!

00:04:48.874 --> 00:04:51.214
They made the wall even thicker.

00:04:59.194 --> 00:05:01.954
I should've brought a communicator.

00:05:05.224 --> 00:05:07.994
Geo will be mad at me again.

00:05:08.364 --> 00:05:09.494
Now...

00:05:13.434 --> 00:05:17.534
The highest mental-energy
concentration in this castle is...

00:05:19.444 --> 00:05:21.874
The proof of the Pillar is here.

00:05:36.694 --> 00:05:39.124
I have no time...

00:05:46.234 --> 00:05:50.674
You first saw Nova and Debonair
back when we were in Tokyo?

00:05:55.014 --> 00:05:58.604
At first, they were just in my dreams...

00:05:59.554 --> 00:06:01.414
Did you have dreams like that?

00:06:01.414 --> 00:06:02.544
Did you have dreams like that?
No.

00:06:02.654 --> 00:06:04.584
Then why just Hikaru?

00:06:05.254 --> 00:06:08.084
I'm sorry I kept quiet about it.

00:06:09.364 --> 00:06:12.654
At first, I thought
they were just dreams.

00:06:13.364 --> 00:06:16.454
But then we were
summoned to Cephiro again...

00:06:17.434 --> 00:06:20.594
...and Nova and
Debonair really appeared...

00:06:22.234 --> 00:06:23.574
Nova said...

00:06:24.904 --> 00:06:27.404
...she'd do something to you two...

00:06:27.514 --> 00:06:29.104
She'd kill us?

00:06:32.784 --> 00:06:36.584
I'm really angry right now!

00:06:43.864 --> 00:06:45.354
At myself.

00:06:46.634 --> 00:06:49.894
You were worried about
Nova all this time, right?

00:06:50.004 --> 00:06:53.094
Still, I'm mad at myself...

00:06:53.404 --> 00:06:57.964
...for not being strong enough
for you to tell me about it.

00:06:58.744 --> 00:07:00.174
It's not that!

00:07:00.574 --> 00:07:01.944
I also...

00:07:02.444 --> 00:07:05.884
I also feel the same way as Ms. Umi.

00:07:06.554 --> 00:07:08.544
Hey, Hikaru...

00:07:09.724 --> 00:07:13.174
We were summoned
here to Cephiro again...

00:07:13.554 --> 00:07:16.024
...although we don't know by who.

00:07:17.124 --> 00:07:20.154
This isn't the world that we live in.

00:07:20.434 --> 00:07:24.264
Why is it that you want
to protect this country?

00:07:25.874 --> 00:07:31.504
Because I want to protect the people
we love in Cephiro, like Clef and Presea.

00:07:35.314 --> 00:07:36.574
Me too.

00:07:38.084 --> 00:07:39.514
Myself as well.

00:07:39.984 --> 00:07:41.044
Umi...

00:07:41.414 --> 00:07:42.514
Fuu...

00:07:43.824 --> 00:07:45.784
It's not a huge wish...

00:07:45.894 --> 00:07:50.484
...like saving the world
or bringing justice to the people.

00:07:55.234 --> 00:08:00.164
I just want the people I love
in this country to be happy.

00:08:01.174 --> 00:08:04.604
I decided for myself
to fight for that reason.

00:08:05.444 --> 00:08:06.514
Until the end.

00:08:06.514 --> 00:08:08.344
Until the end.
The three of us together, right?

00:08:08.344 --> 00:08:09.334
The three of us together, right?

00:08:31.704 --> 00:08:34.894
Here, your favorite
tea and snack, Lady Aska...

00:08:34.974 --> 00:08:37.204
...peach pastries.

00:08:39.274 --> 00:08:40.644
Thank you.

00:08:45.014 --> 00:08:47.314
Lady Aska isn't very enthused...

00:08:47.414 --> 00:08:52.324
She has been like this ever
since that Magic Knight left.

00:09:03.334 --> 00:09:06.134
But if you become the Pillar...

00:09:06.234 --> 00:09:09.364
...you will not be allowed
to fall in love with anyone.

00:09:09.474 --> 00:09:15.574
The Pillar of Cephiro supports this
country's peace and order all by herself.

00:09:16.584 --> 00:09:19.774
She is only permitted
to love the country itself.

00:09:19.884 --> 00:09:22.854
She is unable to make herself happy.

00:09:31.864 --> 00:09:32.824
Sang Yung.

00:09:32.894 --> 00:09:34.154
Y-Yes!

00:09:35.494 --> 00:09:37.024
Cephiro is...

00:09:40.304 --> 00:09:43.764
...not a dream world
that can grant any wish.

00:09:52.584 --> 00:09:55.174
Lady Aska, have a look at this!

00:09:56.884 --> 00:09:58.144
This is...

00:09:58.254 --> 00:10:00.684
...the battleship from Autozam!

00:10:06.864 --> 00:10:09.024
I can't wait any longer! Zazu!

00:10:09.134 --> 00:10:11.464
Get the GTO ready for takeoff!

00:10:11.564 --> 00:10:16.064
Don't be ridiculous, Geo! What are
you going to do with just the GTO?

00:10:16.174 --> 00:10:18.404
Rescue the commander.

00:10:18.504 --> 00:10:22.874
If you don't hear from me in three
hours, you're in command of the NSX.

00:10:24.784 --> 00:10:26.044
You're kidding!

00:10:27.784 --> 00:10:30.374
I'm leaving the rest to you, Zazu.

00:10:32.954 --> 00:10:34.214
Look, Geo!

00:10:37.864 --> 00:10:40.124
This can't be happening...

00:10:43.264 --> 00:10:46.394
At a time like this...
the Dome of Fahren?

00:10:49.104 --> 00:10:52.094
That's the dragon from Fahren.

00:10:53.274 --> 00:10:54.714
Ms. Aska...

00:11:07.654 --> 00:11:10.094
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:10.194 --> 00:11:14.664
Autozam
Geo
Eagle
Zazu

00:11:14.664 --> 00:11:17.094
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:17.204 --> 00:11:20.634
Fahren
Aska Chang Ang
Sang Yung

00:11:26.874 --> 00:11:31.074
To think that Autozam's
battleship is already this close...

00:11:31.814 --> 00:11:35.014
The Rune-Gods! Why aren't
the Rune-Gods coming out?

00:11:35.654 --> 00:11:37.584
I do not know.

00:11:38.254 --> 00:11:40.984
Perhaps they were already defeated?

00:11:48.234 --> 00:11:52.434
I will not allow it!

00:11:53.004 --> 00:11:57.264
I won't! I won't!
I won't ever allow that!

00:11:57.574 --> 00:12:00.044
Fuu won against me!

00:12:00.144 --> 00:12:02.904
She can't lose against Autozam!

00:12:03.744 --> 00:12:04.834
Sang Yung!

00:12:05.184 --> 00:12:06.274
Y-Yes!

00:12:06.484 --> 00:12:07.614
Brush and paper!

00:12:07.614 --> 00:12:08.814
Brush and paper!
Right away!

00:12:09.684 --> 00:12:11.274
Lady Aska!

00:12:12.124 --> 00:12:14.384
I'm going to chase Autozam away.

00:12:18.864 --> 00:12:22.324
I don't want to be
the Pillar of Cephiro anymore.

00:12:22.434 --> 00:12:23.864
Lady Aska...

00:12:24.434 --> 00:12:27.924
I love the people of Fahren.

00:12:28.274 --> 00:12:32.974
Therefore, I can't just think
about Cephiro all of the time.

00:12:35.514 --> 00:12:41.044
If I were to do such a thing, Cephiro
would be in ruins like it is now.

00:12:42.054 --> 00:12:46.384
It's impossible for me
to rule over two countries.

00:12:57.604 --> 00:13:00.394
I am proud that you realized that.

00:13:00.504 --> 00:13:04.704
I knew once we came here,
you would understand...

00:13:04.844 --> 00:13:11.374
...that the Pillar of Cephiro
is not something to yearn for.

00:13:12.214 --> 00:13:15.814
I promised Fuu
that I would have tea with her!

00:13:16.954 --> 00:13:18.254
So...

00:13:21.494 --> 00:13:23.984
I will chase those of Autozam away!

00:13:24.094 --> 00:13:27.294
Sang Yung!
Paper and brush for Lady Aska!

00:13:27.364 --> 00:13:28.694
Yes! Right away!

00:13:30.504 --> 00:13:33.264
Secret Spell of
Dragon Art Reincarnation!

00:13:42.414 --> 00:13:44.174
What is this sound?

00:14:17.814 --> 00:14:20.404
W-What in the world is that?

00:14:25.654 --> 00:14:28.484
Do you think we should wave back?

00:14:30.894 --> 00:14:34.054
That must be the doing
of Fahren's princess.

00:14:41.174 --> 00:14:43.264
Zazu, brace yourself!

00:14:44.004 --> 00:14:45.444
It's coming again!

00:14:51.444 --> 00:14:56.184
At this rate, the NSX will be
in pieces before Eagle gets back!

00:15:00.824 --> 00:15:02.124
You're right.

00:15:04.064 --> 00:15:06.324
Eagle will be coming back.

00:15:07.734 --> 00:15:11.494
My job is to believe in him
and keep watch till he does.

00:15:17.074 --> 00:15:19.264
But we're getting kicked around...

00:15:19.404 --> 00:15:23.204
Quick, raise the ship!
I want this ship above the clouds!

00:15:30.284 --> 00:15:33.224
Giant Sang Yung is powerful after all!

00:15:33.954 --> 00:15:35.544
That again?

00:15:35.824 --> 00:15:37.154
What are you saying?

00:15:37.264 --> 00:15:41.354
Giant Sang Yung is powerful
because I put my all into making it!

00:15:43.404 --> 00:15:48.304
My heart is strongly committed,
so giant Sang Yung is powerful.

00:15:51.504 --> 00:15:53.994
Go, giant Sang Yung!

00:15:54.344 --> 00:15:56.604
Follow that battleship!

00:16:05.324 --> 00:16:07.384
Shield generators, all green.

00:16:07.494 --> 00:16:10.424
No problems reported
with the hull or engines!

00:16:12.524 --> 00:16:16.124
Thanks to the shield,
we didn't suffer much damage.

00:16:16.434 --> 00:16:18.364
Boy, was I scared.

00:16:19.564 --> 00:16:21.864
For a moment, I was wondering...

00:16:23.804 --> 00:16:25.064
What is it?

00:16:25.474 --> 00:16:28.674
It's below our ship!
Directly below! It's closing in!

00:16:28.774 --> 00:16:30.244
That can't be...

00:16:30.544 --> 00:16:32.484
We're above the clouds now.

00:16:42.754 --> 00:16:43.884
Full reverse!

00:16:58.974 --> 00:17:02.414
How annoying,
moving around like that!

00:17:10.254 --> 00:17:11.914
Open all cannon bays!

00:17:12.024 --> 00:17:14.954
The next time it comes up,
we'll have a chance!

00:17:33.144 --> 00:17:34.334
Fire!

00:17:51.264 --> 00:17:54.454
Both the missiles and
the lasers are ineffective!

00:17:55.064 --> 00:17:57.934
If that's a machine, I really want it.

00:17:58.904 --> 00:18:00.874
Forward shields to full!

00:18:01.334 --> 00:18:03.604
We're gonna ram it from here!

00:18:04.744 --> 00:18:07.834
Don't take the power
of the NSX lightly...

00:18:25.024 --> 00:18:26.684
How dare you!

00:18:27.134 --> 00:18:28.324
Lady Aska!

00:18:28.494 --> 00:18:30.264
Are you all right?

00:18:31.204 --> 00:18:33.394
I'm going to end this right now!

00:18:33.934 --> 00:18:35.094
Man...

00:18:35.874 --> 00:18:37.634
We're pretty torn up.

00:18:37.744 --> 00:18:40.364
Geo, this doesn't
look good. At this rate...

00:18:42.744 --> 00:18:45.144
The next one will be the last.

00:18:45.244 --> 00:18:47.684
Prepare to fire the laguna cannons!

00:18:58.794 --> 00:19:01.924
Energy charge complete!
We're ready to fire!

00:19:09.404 --> 00:19:10.734
Fire!

00:19:16.684 --> 00:19:17.974
Engine damage!

00:19:18.084 --> 00:19:20.644
At this rate, it'll overheat!

00:19:21.654 --> 00:19:24.954
I don't care!
All power to the laguna cannons!

00:19:40.374 --> 00:19:41.334
It's done?

00:19:41.434 --> 00:19:45.374
I don't know. It may have
melted and then evaporated.

00:19:48.774 --> 00:19:52.374
Well, we can't move
for a while in either case.

00:19:53.044 --> 00:19:55.144
We have time for repairs.

00:19:55.584 --> 00:19:56.514
What?

00:19:56.924 --> 00:19:59.184
Geo! Look at the screen!

00:19:59.584 --> 00:20:02.144
T-The laguna cannons didn't work?

00:20:02.754 --> 00:20:05.094
I... I did it...

00:20:07.064 --> 00:20:08.294
Lady Aska!

00:20:09.264 --> 00:20:12.794
Now keep that battleship
far away from the castle.

00:20:13.134 --> 00:20:15.794
Lady Aska! Steady yourself!

00:20:15.904 --> 00:20:17.334
Lady Aska!

00:20:19.474 --> 00:20:23.344
I'm going to have tea with Fuu...

00:20:34.794 --> 00:20:38.724
Why did Fahren take
the battleship from Autozam away?

00:20:38.964 --> 00:20:43.294
Are we going to fight that
huge Chinese ghost again?

00:20:44.234 --> 00:20:47.434
The people of Fahren
were all good people.

00:20:47.534 --> 00:20:50.004
I don't want to fight them if possible.

00:20:50.104 --> 00:20:51.934
Chizeta was the same way.

00:20:52.044 --> 00:20:54.774
They have two funny princesses.

00:20:55.874 --> 00:20:58.214
I thought we could be friends.

00:20:59.014 --> 00:21:03.954
Ms. Aska seems to have someone
she cherishes more than Cephiro.

00:21:05.284 --> 00:21:09.854
I hope she understands that she will
have to throw away those feelings...

00:21:09.964 --> 00:21:12.194
...to become Cephiro's Pillar.

00:21:16.534 --> 00:21:19.004
Someone she cherishes...

00:21:20.104 --> 00:21:23.334
You know he's not
going to love you back...

00:21:23.444 --> 00:21:24.804
Why are you falling for him?

00:21:24.804 --> 00:21:25.904
The trembling night winds
pass by with a whisper...
Why are you falling for him?

00:21:25.904 --> 00:21:32.284
The trembling night winds
pass by with a whisper...

00:21:32.284 --> 00:21:33.284
The trembling night winds
pass by with a whisper...
Hikaru doesn't hate you either.

00:21:33.284 --> 00:21:34.354
Hikaru doesn't hate you either.

00:21:34.354 --> 00:21:35.414
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.
Hikaru doesn't hate you either.

00:21:35.414 --> 00:21:36.414
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.

00:21:36.414 --> 00:21:38.884
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.
No, she loves you too.

00:21:38.884 --> 00:21:40.024
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.

00:21:40.024 --> 00:21:41.324
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.
Hikaru...

00:21:41.324 --> 00:21:42.224
...as if they blow out
the flame deep in my heart.

00:21:42.324 --> 00:21:43.964
If we hadn't been enemies...

00:21:43.964 --> 00:21:45.964
How I tried to keep myself fooled...
If we hadn't been enemies...

00:21:45.964 --> 00:21:49.094
How I tried to keep myself fooled...
...we might have been
able to become friends.

00:21:49.094 --> 00:21:52.534
How I tried to keep myself fooled...

00:21:53.404 --> 00:21:59.174
...by putting on those chains,
and now they're all ashes.

00:21:59.174 --> 00:22:01.234
...by putting on those chains,
and now they're all ashes.
The proof of the Pillar...

00:22:01.444 --> 00:22:08.374
The only way is to keep praying.

00:22:08.554 --> 00:22:10.814
It will be mine.

00:22:17.964 --> 00:22:23.394
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:24.034 --> 00:22:31.304
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.774 --> 00:22:38.304
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:39.014 --> 00:22:42.814
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.184 --> 00:22:45.584
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.394 --> 00:22:50.684
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.064 --> 00:22:54.424
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.834 --> 00:23:01.764
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.174 --> 00:23:05.604
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.904 --> 00:23:14.334
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.184 --> 00:23:20.524
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.754 --> 00:23:28.824
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.904 --> 00:23:37.704
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.544 --> 00:23:48.574
What, Mokona?
The next Rayearth is...

00:23:48.684 --> 00:23:50.884
...The Crown Room
and the Pillar's Memory?

00:23:50.984 --> 00:23:54.324
So someone will finally
enter the crown room?

00:23:54.424 --> 00:23:58.424
The Crown Room and the Pillar's Memory
The next Magic Knight Rayearth
will air October 16!

00:23:58.424 --> 00:24:06.354
Who is it today?

00:24:06.534 --> 00:24:08.334
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:08.434 --> 00:24:09.034
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:09.034 --> 00:24:11.344
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:11.344 --> 00:24:13.174
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:13.174 --> 00:24:14.404
Look forward to the next episode!
